WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.457
The Bass trace conjecture, every group.

2
00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:07.174
Bass: the trace of an idempotent sees only elements of finite order.

3
00:00:07.324 --> 00:00:10.532
For torsion-free groups, idempotents are then zero and one.

4
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:14.808
Claimed: the analytic version holds for every discrete group.

5
00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:17.719
Lean checks the algebraic version.
